<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <title>Attic</title>
  <!--
    Attic's window. Served by the Attic agent on 127.0.0.1 and rendered by the
    Craft runtime with the titlebar hidden over the system's window material,
    so the page draws its own Mail-style chrome: a translucent sidebar under
    the traffic lights, a conversation list, and the transcript.
  -->
  <style>
    :root {
      --label: rgba(0, 0, 0, .86);
      --secondary: rgba(0, 0, 0, .52);
      --tertiary: rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
      --separator: rgba(0, 0, 0, .09);
      --accent: #007aff;
      --sidebar-selected: rgba(0, 0, 0, .08);
      --list-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
      --pane-bg: #ffffff;
      --row-selected: #0a6cff;
      --bubble-in: #e9e9eb;
      --bubble-in-text: #000;
      --bubble-imessage: #0b84fe;
      --bubble-sms: #34c759;
      --chip: rgba(0, 0, 0, .05);
      --amber: #bf6f00;
      --window-controls-height: var(--craft-window-controls-height, 28px);
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --label: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88);
        --secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, .55);
        --tertiary: rgba(255, 255, 255, .28);
        --separator: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
        --accent: #0a84ff;
        --sidebar-selected: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
        --list-bg: rgba(30, 30, 30, .72);
        --pane-bg: #1e1e1e;
        --row-selected: #0a6cff;
        --bubble-in: #3a3a3c;
        --bubble-in-text: #fff;
        --chip: rgba(255, 255, 255, .07);
        --amber: #ffb340;
      }
    }
    @supports (color: -apple-system-label) {
      :root {
        --label: -apple-system-label;
        --secondary: -apple-system-secondary-label;
        --tertiary: -apple-system-tertiary-label;
        --separator: -apple-system-separator;
        --accent: -apple-system-control-accent;
      }
    }

    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }
    /* Outside Craft there is no window material behind the page, so paint the
       sidebar grey a Mac draws there (development in a browser, screenshots). */
    html:not([data-craft-window-controls]) body { background: #ececee; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      html:not([data-craft-window-controls]) body { background: #262628; }
    }
    body {
      font: 13px/1.38 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Text', sans-serif;
      color: var(--label);
      background: transparent;
      -webkit-user-select: none;
      user-select: none;
      cursor: default;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
    .selectable { -webkit-user-select: text; user-select: text; cursor: text; }

    .sidebar-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 5px 9px; margin: 1px 10px; border-radius: 7px;
      background: none; border: 0; width: calc(100% - 20px); text-align: left;
    }
    .sidebar-item[aria-current='true'] { background: var(--sidebar-selected); }
    .sidebar-item .count { margin-left: auto; color: var(--secondary); font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .row {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; gap: 10px;
      padding: 9px 12px 9px 18px; margin: 0 8px; border-radius: 9px; position: relative;
    }
    .row + .row::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 68px; right: 10px; height: 1px; background: var(--separator);
    }
    .row[aria-selected='true'] { background: var(--row-selected); color: #fff; }
    .row[aria-selected='true']::before, .row[aria-selected='true'] + .row::before { display: none; }
    .row[aria-selected='true'] .muted { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); }
    .row .unread {
      position: absolute; left: 5px; top: 50%; width: 9px; height: 9px; margin-top: -5px;
      border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent);
    }
    .muted { color: var(--secondary); }

    .avatar {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #a5abb8, #858994);
      color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: .02em;
    }
    .avatar.large { width: 30px; height: 30px; font-size: 12px; }
    .avatar.small { width: 18px; height: 18px; font-size: 8px; }
    /* A profile picture covers the initials; the source badge stays on top. */
    .avatar .photo { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
    .source-badge {
      position: absolute; right: -2px; bottom: -2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--list-bg);
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
      font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--chip); color: var(--secondary);
    }
    .row[aria-selected='true'] .tag { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .2); color: #fff; }

    .toolbar-button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
      height: 28px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 7px;
      border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--label);
    }
    .toolbar-button:hover { background: var(--chip); }
    .toolbar-button:active { background: var(--sidebar-selected); }
    .toolbar-button[disabled] { opacity: .4; }

    .bubble {
      max-width: min(70%, 520px); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 18px;
      white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; position: relative;
    }
    .bubble.in { background: var(--bubble-in); color: var(--bubble-in-text); }
    .bubble.out { background: var(--bubble-imessage); color: #fff; }
    .bubble.out.sms { background: var(--bubble-sms); }
    .bubble.attic { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--amber); }
    .reactions {
      position: absolute; top: -12px; display: flex; gap: 2px;
      background: var(--pane-bg); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1px 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--separator); font-size: 11px;
    }
    .bubble.in .reactions { right: -10px; }
    .bubble.out .reactions { left: -10px; }

    .search {
      width: 100%; height: 28px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 8px 0 26px;
      border-radius: 7px; border: 0; outline: none;
      background: var(--chip); color: var(--label); font: inherit;
    }
    .search:focus { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent); }

    .scroller { overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; }
    .scroller::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
    .scroller::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--tertiary); border-radius: 4px; }

    mark { background: color-mix(in srgb, #ffd60a 55%, transparent); color: inherit; border-radius: 2px; }

    .banner {
      display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--chip);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<script client>
import { app, contextMenu, menu, notifications, showMessageBox, standardMenus } from '@stacksjs/desktop/browser'

/* ---------- state ---------- */
const view = state('inbox')
const source = state('all')
const sources = state([])
const connecting = state('')
const tokenDraft = state('')
const userDraft = state('')
const inbox = state([])
const archived = state([])
const deletedList = state([])
const selectedKey = state('')
const detail = state(null)
const messages = state([])
const hasEarlier = state(false)
const loadingMessages = state(false)
const access = state('granted')
const fixture = state(false)
const resurface = state('inbox')
const removal = state('confirm')
const accessible = state(true)
const query = state('')
const results = state([])
const searching = state(false)
const busy = state('')
const flash = state('')
/* Always archive: rules for a person or a group. */
const rules = state([])
const rulesOpen = state(false)

/* Clean up: bulk archive of everything quiet for longer than a cutoff. */
const BULK_AGES = [{ days: 182, label: '6 months' }, { days: 365, label: '1 year' }, { days: 730, label: '2 years' }]
const bulkOpen = state(false)
const bulkDays = state(365)
const bulkPreview = state(null)
const bulkJob = state(null)
/** Picture URLs that failed to load, so the initials show instead of a broken image. */
const failedAvatars = state([])

const list = derived(() => (view() === 'archived' ? archived() : view() === 'deleted' ? deletedList() : inbox()))
/**
 * Rows actually rendered. A real Messages history runs to thousands of
 * conversations; drawing them all made the window take seconds to appear and
 * to respond, so the list grows a page at a time as it is scrolled.
 */
const LIST_PAGE = 120
const listLimit = state(LIST_PAGE)
const shownList = derived(() => list().slice(0, listLimit()))
const deletedCount = derived(() => deletedList().length)
const inboxCount = derived(() => inbox().length)
const archivedCount = derived(() => archived().length)
const selected = derived(() => list().find(c => c.key === selectedKey()) ?? null)
const needsAccess = derived(() => access() === 'needs-full-disk-access')
const noMessages = derived(() => access() === 'no-messages')
const anyConnected = derived(() => sources().some(s => s.status.connected))
const SOURCE_ICONS = { imessage: 'i-hugeicons-message-01', whatsapp: 'i-hugeicons-whatsapp', slack: 'i-hugeicons-slack', discord: 'i-hugeicons-discord' }
const SOURCE_COLORS = { imessage: '#0a84ff', whatsapp: '#25d366', slack: '#e01e5a', discord: '#5865f2' }
const showingResults = derived(() => query().trim().length > 0)

/* ---------- formatting ---------- */
const timeOnly = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, { hour: 'numeric', minute: '2-digit' })
const weekday = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, { weekday: 'long' })
const shortDate = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, { month: 'numeric', day: 'numeric', year: '2-digit' })
const longDate = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, { weekday: 'long', month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })

function startOfDay(ms) {
  const d = new Date(ms)
  d.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0)
  return d.getTime()
}

/** The list's timestamp, the way Messages writes it. */
function when(ms) {
  if (!ms)
    return ''
  const today = startOfDay(Date.now())
  if (ms >= today)
    return timeOnly.format(ms)
  if (ms >= today - 86_400_000)
    return 'Yesterday'
  if (ms >= today - 6 * 86_400_000)
    return weekday.format(ms)
  return shortDate.format(ms)
}

function dayLabel(ms) {
  const today = startOfDay(Date.now())
  if (ms >= today)
    return `Today ${timeOnly.format(ms)}`
  if (ms >= today - 86_400_000)
    return `Yesterday ${timeOnly.format(ms)}`
  return `${longDate.format(ms)} at ${timeOnly.format(ms)}`
}

function bytes(n) {
  if (!n)
    return '0 KB'
  const units = ['bytes', 'KB', 'MB', 'GB']
  let i = 0
  let v = n
  while (v >= 1024 && i < units.length - 1) {
    v /= 1024
    i++
  }
  return `${v < 10 && i > 0 ? v.toFixed(1) : Math.round(v)} ${units[i]}`
}

const REACTIONS = { 2000: '❤️', 2001: '👍', 2002: '👎', 2003: '😂', 2004: '‼️', 2005: '❓', 2006: '😀', 2007: '🔖' }
function reactionGlyph(type) {
  return REACTIONS[type] ?? '•'
}

function preview(c) {
  if (view() === 'deleted' && !c.saved)
    return `${c.deleted.toLocaleString()} messages in ${appName(c.provider)}' Recently Deleted`
  if (!c.inApp)
    return c.savedMessages > 0 ? `${c.savedMessages.toLocaleString()} messages kept by Attic` : 'Kept by Attic'
  return c.preview ?? 'Attachment'
}

function snippetHtml(snippet) {
  const escaped = snippet.replace(/[&<>"']/g, ch => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', '\'': '&#39;' })[ch])
  return escaped.replace(/\u0001/g, '<mark>').replace(/\u0002/g, '</mark>')
}

function eventText(m) {
  return m.groupTitle ? `Named the conversation “${m.groupTitle}”` : (m.text || 'Conversation updated')
}

function unsentText(m) {
  return m.isFromMe ? 'You unsent a message' : `${m.senderName ?? 'Someone'} unsent a message`
}

function bubbleClass(m) {
  return [m.isFromMe ? 'out' : 'in', m.inApp ? '' : 'attic'].join(' ')
}

/** Your own bubbles take the app's colour: iMessage blue, WhatsApp teal, Slack berry, Discord blurple. */
function bubbleStyle(m) {
  if (!m.isFromMe)
    return ''
  const provider = detail()?.provider
  return provider === 'whatsapp' ? 'background: #128c7e' : provider === 'slack' ? 'background: #611f69' : provider === 'discord' ? 'background: #5865f2' : ''
}

function keptSummary(d) {
  if (!d || !d.saved)
    return ''
  const parts = [`${d.savedMessages.toLocaleString()} messages kept`]
  if (d.attachments)
    parts.push(`${d.attachments} attachments (${bytes(d.attachmentBytes)})`)
  return ` · ${parts.join(' · ')}`
}

function isImage(a) {
  return !!a.mimeType && a.mimeType.startsWith('image/') && a.available
}

function isVideo(a) {
  return !!a.mimeType && a.mimeType.startsWith('video/') && a.available
}

function isAudio(a) {
  return !!a.mimeType && a.mimeType.startsWith('audio/') && a.available
}

function isFile(a) {
  return !isImage(a) && !isVideo(a) && !isAudio(a)
}

/** The transcript, newest first (the scroller is column-reverse), with a day header where the gap is large. */
const timeline = derived(() => {
  const rows = []
  // WhatsApp notices with nothing to say (polls, pins and the like the driver
  // cannot read) would only repeat "Conversation updated"; leave them out.
  const all = detail()?.provider === 'whatsapp' ? messages().filter(m => m.kind !== 'event' || m.text) : messages()
  for (let i = all.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
    const m = all[i]
    const prev = all[i - 1]
    rows.push({ type: 'message', id: m.guid, m, showSender: detail()?.kind === 'group' && !m.isFromMe && (!prev || prev.sender !== m.sender || prev.isFromMe) })
    // Pushed bottom-up: the day header sits directly above its message, and
    // the "kept by Attic" divider above that.
    const gap = !prev || m.sentAt - prev.sentAt > 60 * 60_000
    if (gap)
      rows.push({ type: 'day', id: `day-${m.guid}`, label: dayLabel(m.sentAt) })
    if (prev && !prev.inApp && m.inApp)
      rows.push({ type: 'kept', id: `kept-${m.guid}` })
  }
  return rows
})

/* ---------- data ---------- */
async function api(path, init) {
  const response = await fetch(path, { credentials: 'same-origin', ...init, headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json', ...(init?.headers ?? {}) } })
  const data = await response.json().catch(() => ({}))
  if (!response.ok)
    throw new Error(data.error || `Request failed (${response.status})`)
  return data
}

async function post(path, payload) {
  return api(path, { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(payload) })
}

async function loadStatus() {
  const status = await api('/api/status')
  access.set(status.access)
  sources.set(status.sources)
  fixture.set(status.fixture)
  resurface.set(status.settings.resurface)
  removal.set(status.settings.removal)
  accessible.set(status.accessibility)
}

async function loadLists() {
  const [a, b, d] = await Promise.all([
    api(`/api/conversations?view=inbox&source=${source()}`),
    api(`/api/conversations?view=archived&source=${source()}`),
    api(`/api/conversations?view=deleted&source=${source()}`),
  ])
  inbox.set(a)
  archived.set(b)
  deletedList.set(d)
}

async function loadConversation(key) {
  if (!key) {
    detail.set(null)
    messages.set([])
    return
  }
  loadingMessages.set(true)
  try {
    const [info, transcript] = await Promise.all([
      api(`/api/conversation?key=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`),
      api(`/api/messages?key=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`),
    ])
    if (selectedKey() !== key)
      return
    detail.set(info)
    // A refresh that changed nothing leaves the rendered transcript alone.
    if (fingerprint(transcript.messages) !== fingerprint(messages()))
      messages.set(transcript.messages)
    hasEarlier.set(transcript.hasEarlier)
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
  finally {
    loadingMessages.set(false)
  }
}

/** Identity of a transcript as rendered: every message, edit, unsend and reaction. */
function fingerprint(list) {
  return list.map(m => `${m.guid}:${m.editedAt ?? ''}:${m.unsent ? 1 : 0}:${m.reactions.length}:${m.inApp ? 1 : 0}`).join('|')
}

async function loadEarlier() {
  const first = messages()[0]
  if (!first)
    return
  const key = selectedKey()
  const transcript = await api(`/api/messages?key=${encodeURIComponent(key)}&before=${first.sentAt}`)
  if (selectedKey() !== key)
    return
  messages.set([...transcript.messages, ...messages()])
  hasEarlier.set(transcript.hasEarlier)
}

async function refresh() {
  await loadStatus().catch(() => {})
  await loadLists().catch(() => {})
  if (selectedKey()) {
    const stillThere = list().some(c => c.key === selectedKey())
    if (stillThere)
      await loadConversation(selectedKey())
  }
}

function say(text) {
  flash.set(text)
  setTimeout(() => {
    if (flash() === text)
      flash.set('')
  }, 4000)
}

/* ---------- actions ---------- */
function select(key) {
  if (selectedKey() === key)
    return
  selectedKey.set(key)
  try {
    localStorage.setItem('attic:selected', key)
  }
  catch {}
  loadConversation(key)
}

function show(next) {
  listLimit.set(LIST_PAGE)
  view.set(next)
  query.set('')
  const first = list()[0]
  select(first ? first.key : '')
}

async function pickSource(next) {
  listLimit.set(LIST_PAGE)
  source.set(next)
  view.set('inbox')
  query.set('')
  await loadLists()
  const first = list()[0]
  select(first ? first.key : '')
}

async function loadRules() {
  try {
    rules.set(await api('/api/rules'))
  }
  catch {}
}

/** "Always archive" from a conversation: its person, or the group itself. */
async function setRule(c) {
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/rules/for-conversation', { key: c.key })
    rules.set(result.rules)
    await loadLists()
    say(`Always archiving ${result.rule.label}: new messages still reach you, then go into the archive.`)
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
}

async function deleteRule(rule) {
  const result = await post('/api/rules/delete', { id: rule.id })
  rules.set(result.rules)
  await loadLists()
  say(`Stopped always archiving ${rule.label}. What Attic already kept stays.`)
}

function ruleAppName(provider) {
  return appName(provider) === 'Messages' ? 'Messages' : appName(provider)
}

async function previewBulk() {
  bulkPreview.set(null)
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/bulk/preview', { olderThanDays: bulkDays(), source: source() })
    bulkPreview.set(result)
    if (result.running)
      bulkJob.set(result.running)
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
}

function openBulk() {
  bulkOpen.set(true)
  previewBulk()
}

function pickBulkAge(days) {
  bulkDays.set(days)
  previewBulk()
}

function bulkBreakdown() {
  const counts = bulkPreview()?.byProvider ?? {}
  return Object.entries(counts).map(([provider, n]) => `${n.toLocaleString()} ${appName(provider) === 'Messages' ? 'iMessage' : appName(provider)}`).join(', ')
}

async function startBulk() {
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/bulk/archive', { olderThanDays: bulkDays(), source: source() })
    bulkJob.set(result.job)
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
}

async function cancelBulk() {
  const result = await post('/api/bulk/cancel', {})
  bulkJob.set(result.job)
}

/** The message a reply quotes, as a one-line preview; null when it is not in what is loaded. */
function quoted(m) {
  if (!m.replyToGuid)
    return null
  const original = messages().find(o => o.guid === m.replyToGuid)
  if (!original)
    return null
  const what = original.text || (original.attachments?.length ? (isImage(original.attachments[0]) ? 'Photo' : original.attachments[0].name) : 'Message')
  return `${original.senderName ?? ''}${original.senderName ? ': ' : ''}${what.length > 90 ? `${what.slice(0, 90)}…` : what}`
}

function showAvatar(url) {
  return !!url && !failedAvatars().includes(url)
}

function avatarFailed(url) {
  if (url && !failedAvatars().includes(url))
    failedAvatars.set([...failedAvatars(), url])
}

function appName(provider) {
  return provider === 'whatsapp' ? 'WhatsApp' : provider === 'slack' ? 'Slack' : provider === 'discord' ? 'Discord' : 'Messages'
}

/** Read from this Mac rather than through a token: set up in System Settings, not a sheet. */
function isLocal(provider) {
  return provider === 'imessage' || provider === 'whatsapp'
}

function sourceDetail(provider) {
  return sources().find(s => s.provider === provider)?.status.detail ?? ''
}

function connectedTo(provider) {
  return sources().some(s => s.provider === provider && s.status.connected)
}

const listTitle = derived(() => {
  if (view() === 'archived')
    return 'Archived'
  if (view() === 'deleted')
    return 'Recently Deleted'
  return source() === 'all' ? 'All Inboxes' : appName(source()) === 'Messages' ? 'iMessage' : appName(source())
})

function archiveLabel() {
  return view() === 'deleted' ? 'Keep in Attic' : 'Archive'
}

function archiveHint(d) {
  if (!d)
    return 'Archive (⌃⌘A)'
  if (view() === 'deleted')
    return 'Copy it into Attic\'s Archived before Messages purges it'
  const what = d.archiveMode === 'unsupported' ? 'Archive in Attic' : 'Archive'
  return `${what} (⌃⌘A). ${d.archiveDetail ?? ''}`.trim()
}

function sourceIcon(provider) {
  return SOURCE_ICONS[provider] ?? 'i-hugeicons-message-01'
}

function colorStyle(provider) {
  return 'color: ' + sourceColor(provider)
}

function badgeStyle(provider) {
  return 'background: ' + sourceColor(provider)
}

function showHint(d) {
  return 'Show in ' + appName(d?.provider) + ' (⌘O)'
}

function sourceColor(provider) {
  return SOURCE_COLORS[provider] ?? 'var(--accent)'
}

function openConnect(provider) {
  connecting.set(provider)
  tokenDraft.set('')
  userDraft.set('')
}

async function saveConnect() {
  const provider = connecting()
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/sources/connect', { provider, token: tokenDraft(), userId: userDraft() })
    sources.set(result.sources)
    const state = result.sources.find(s => s.provider === provider)
    connecting.set('')
    say(state?.status.connected ? `${state.label} is connected.` : (state?.status.detail ?? 'Saved.'))
    await loadLists()
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
}

async function disconnect(provider) {
  const result = await post('/api/sources/disconnect', { provider })
  sources.set(result.sources)
  connecting.set('')
  await loadLists()
}

function move(delta) {
  const rows = list()
  if (rows.length === 0)
    return
  const at = rows.findIndex(c => c.key === selectedKey())
  const index = Math.max(0, Math.min(rows.length - 1, at + delta))
  const next = rows[index]
  if (index >= listLimit() - 5)
    listLimit.set(listLimit() + LIST_PAGE)
  if (next)
    select(next.key)
}

/** Near the bottom of what is drawn, draw the next page. */
function onListScroll(event) {
  const el = event.target
  if (el.scrollTop + el.clientHeight > el.scrollHeight - 800 && listLimit() < list().length)
    listLimit.set(listLimit() + LIST_PAGE)
}

/** Select whatever follows the conversation leaving the current list. */
function selectNeighbour(key) {
  const rows = list()
  const at = rows.findIndex(c => c.key === key)
  const next = rows[at + 1] ?? rows[at - 1]
  selectedKey.set(next ? next.key : '')
  loadConversation(next ? next.key : '')
}

async function archive(key = selectedKey()) {
  const target = list().find(c => c.key === key)
  if (!target || target.state === 'archived')
    return
  busy.set(key)
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/archive', { key })
    if (!result.verified) {
      say('Attic could not copy every message yet, so it stays in the Inbox. Try again in a moment.')
      return
    }
    selectNeighbour(key)
    await loadLists()
    const kept = `${result.messages.toLocaleString()} messages${result.attachmentsCopied ? `, ${result.attachmentsCopied} attachments` : ''} kept`
    say(`Archived ${target.title}: ${kept}. ${result.app?.detail ?? ''}`.trim())
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
  finally {
    busy.set('')
  }
}

async function unarchive(key = selectedKey()) {
  const target = list().find(c => c.key === key)
  if (!target || target.state !== 'archived')
    return
  busy.set(key)
  try {
    const result = await post('/api/unarchive', { key })
    selectNeighbour(key)
    await loadLists()
    say(`${target.title} is back in the Inbox. ${result.app?.detail ?? ''}`.trim())
  }
  finally {
    busy.set('')
  }
}

async function openInMessages(key = selectedKey()) {
  try {
    await post('/api/open', { key })
  }
  catch (error) {
    say(error.message)
  }
}

async function forget(key = selectedKey()) {
  const target = list().find(c => c.key === key)
  if (!target || !target.saved)
    return
  const answer = await showMessageBox({
    type: 'warning',
    title: `Delete Attic's copy of ${target.title}?`,
    message: target.inApp
      ? 'The conversation stays in the app. Attic forgets its archived copy and attachments.'
      : 'This conversation is no longer in the app, so Attic\'s copy may be the only one. It cannot be recovered.',
    buttons: ['Delete Copy', 'Cancel'],
    defaultId: 1,
    cancelId: 1,
  })
  if (answer.response !== 0)
    return
  await post('/api/forget', { key })
  selectNeighbour(key)
  await loadLists()
}

async function setRemoval(mode) {
  const saved = await post('/api/settings', { removal: mode })
  removal.set(saved.removal)
}

async function allowAccessibility() {
  const result = await post('/api/accessibility', {})
  accessible.set(result.trusted)
}

async function setResurface(mode) {
  const saved = await post('/api/settings', { resurface: mode })
  resurface.set(saved.resurface)
}

async function grantAccess() {
  await post('/api/privacy', {})
}

/* ---------- native menus ---------- */
async function rowMenu(event, c) {
  event.preventDefault()
  select(c.key)
  const items = c.state === 'archived'
    ? [{ id: 'unarchive', title: 'Move to Inbox', icon: 'tray.and.arrow.up', shortcut: 'cmd+shift+u' }]
    : [{ id: 'archive', title: 'Archive', icon: 'archivebox', shortcut: 'ctrl+cmd+a' }]
  items.push({ separator: true })
  items.push({
    id: c.rule ? 'rule-stop' : 'rule-start',
    title: c.kind === 'direct' ? `Always Archive ${c.title.split(' ')[0]}` : 'Always Archive This Group',
    icon: 'archivebox.circle',
    checked: !!c.rule,
  })
  items.push({ id: 'open', title: `Show in ${appName(c.provider)}`, icon: 'arrow.up.forward.app', shortcut: 'cmd+o', disabled: !c.url })
  if (c.saved) {
    items.push({ separator: true })
    items.push({ id: 'forget', title: 'Delete Attic\'s Copy…', icon: 'xmark.bin' })
  }
  const choice = await contextMenu.pick({ x: event.clientX, y: event.clientY, targetId: c.key, items })
  if (choice === 'archive')
    archive(c.key)
  else if (choice === 'unarchive')
    unarchive(c.key)
  else if (choice === 'open')
    openInMessages(c.key)
  else if (choice === 'forget')
    forget(c.key)
  else if (choice === 'rule-start')
    setRule(c)
  else if (choice === 'rule-stop' && c.rule)
    deleteRule({ id: c.rule.id, label: c.title })
}

const searchField = useFocus('#search')
function focusSearch() {
  searchField.focus()
}

async function installMenus() {
  await menu.set({
    menus: [
      ...standardMenus.leading('Attic'),
      {
        label: 'Conversation',
        items: [
          { label: 'Archive', shortcut: 'ctrl+cmd+a', onClick: () => archive() },
          { label: 'Move to Inbox', shortcut: 'cmd+shift+u', onClick: () => unarchive() },
          { separator: true },
          { label: 'Show in App', shortcut: 'cmd+o', onClick: () => openInMessages() },
          { separator: true },
          { label: 'Delete Attic\'s Copy…', onClick: () => forget() },
        ],
      },
      {
        label: 'View',
        items: [
          { label: 'Inbox', shortcut: 'cmd+1', onClick: () => show('inbox') },
          { label: 'Archived', shortcut: 'cmd+2', onClick: () => show('archived') },
          { separator: true },
          { label: 'Find', shortcut: 'cmd+f', onClick: () => focusSearch() },
          { label: 'Next Conversation', shortcut: 'cmd+down', onClick: () => move(1) },
          { label: 'Previous Conversation', shortcut: 'cmd+up', onClick: () => move(-1) },
        ],
      },
      standardMenus.window(),
    ],
  })
}

/* ---------- search ---------- */
let searchTimer = 0
effect(() => {
  const q = query().trim()
  clearTimeout(searchTimer)
  if (!q) {
    results.set([])
    return
  }
  searching.set(true)
  searchTimer = setTimeout(async () => {
    try {
      results.set(await api(`/api/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}`))
    }
    finally {
      searching.set(false)
    }
  }, 160)
})

function openResult(hit) {
  const inArchive = archived().some(c => c.key === hit.conversationKey)
  view.set(inArchive ? 'archived' : 'inbox')
  query.set('')
  select(hit.conversationKey)
}

function onListKey(event) {
  if (event.key === 'ArrowDown') {
    event.preventDefault()
    move(1)
  }
  else if (event.key === 'ArrowUp') {
    event.preventDefault()
    move(-1)
  }
}

/* ---------- live updates ---------- */
function listen() {
  const events = new EventSource('/api/events')
  events.onmessage = async (message) => {
    const event = JSON.parse(message.data)
    if (event.type === 'access') {
      access.set(event.state)
      await refresh()
    }
    if (event.type === 'bulk') {
      bulkJob.set(event.job)
      if (event.job?.finished) {
        say(`Cleaned up: ${event.job.archived.toLocaleString()} conversations archived${event.job.removed ? `, ${event.job.removed.toLocaleString()} taken out of the apps` : ''}.`)
        previewBulk()
      }
    }
    if (event.type === 'changed') {
      await loadLists()
      if (selectedKey())
        loadConversation(selectedKey())
      for (const back of event.resurfaced ?? [])
        notifications.show({ title: back.title, body: 'Wrote again, so the conversation is back in your Inbox with its history.' })
    }
  }
}

const params = useSearchParams()
// ?presentation hides development labels, for screenshots of the real app.
const presenting = params.get('presentation') !== null

onMount(async () => {
  await refresh()
  loadRules()
  // ?q= opens with a search filled in.
  const initialQuery = params.get('q')
  if (initialQuery)
    query.set(initialQuery)
  let remembered = ''
  try {
    remembered = localStorage.getItem('attic:selected') ?? ''
  }
  catch {}
  const start = list().find(c => c.key === remembered) ?? list()[0]
  if (start)
    select(start.key)
  listen()
  installMenus()
  app.setBadge(0)
})
</script>

<div data-stx-content class="flex h-screen">
  <!-- Sidebar, on the window material. -->
  <nav class="w-[212px] shrink-0 flex flex-col" aria-label="Mailboxes">
    <div class="shrink-0" style="height: calc(var(--window-controls-height) + 24px)"></div>
    <button class="sidebar-item" :aria-current="view() === 'inbox' && source() === 'all' ? 'true' : 'false'" @click="pickSource('all')">
      <span class="i-hugeicons-inbox text-[15px] text-[var(--accent)]"></span>
      <span>All Inboxes</span>
      <span class="count" :if="source() === 'all'">{{ inboxCount() }}</span>
    </button>
    <button class="sidebar-item" :aria-current="view() === 'archived' ? 'true' : 'false'" @click="show('archived')">
      <span class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[15px] text-[var(--accent)]"></span>
      <span>Archived</span>
      <span class="count">{{ archivedCount() }}</span>
    </button>
    <button :if="deletedCount() > 0" class="sidebar-item" :aria-current="view() === 'deleted' ? 'true' : 'false'" @click="show('deleted')" title="Deleted in Messages, still recoverable there for now">
      <span class="i-hugeicons-delete-02 text-[15px]" style="color: var(--amber)"></span>
      <span>Recently Deleted</span>
      <span class="count">{{ deletedCount() }}</span>
    </button>

    <div class="px-[19px] pt-4 pb-1 text-[11px] font-semibold muted">Sources</div>
    <div :for="s in sources()" :key="s.provider" class="contents">
      <button class="sidebar-item" :aria-current="view() === 'inbox' && source() === s.provider ? 'true' : 'false'" @click="s.status.connected ? pickSource(s.provider) : openConnect(s.provider)" :title="s.status.detail">
        <span class="text-[15px]" :class="sourceIcon(s.provider)" :style="colorStyle(s.provider)"></span>
        <span>{{ s.label }}</span>
        <span :if="s.status.connected" class="count">{{ source() === s.provider ? inboxCount() : '' }}</span>
        <span :if="!s.status.connected && !isLocal(s.provider)" class="count" style="color: var(--accent)">Connect</span>
        <span :if="!s.status.connected && isLocal(s.provider)" class="count" style="color: var(--amber)">Set up</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-auto px-4 pb-4 text-[11.5px] muted leading-snug">
      <div class="font-semibold mb-1.5" style="color: var(--label)">When someone writes again</div>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
        <input type="radio" name="resurface" :checked="resurface() === 'inbox'" @change="setResurface('inbox')">
        <span>Move it back to the Inbox</span>
      </label>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
        <input type="radio" name="resurface" :checked="resurface() === 'stay'" @change="setResurface('stay')">
        <span>Keep it archived</span>
      </label>
      <div class="font-semibold mt-4 mb-1.5" style="color: var(--label)">When you archive</div>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
        <input type="radio" name="removal" :checked="removal() === 'auto'" @change="setRemoval('auto')">
        <span>Take it out of the app</span>
      </label>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
        <input type="radio" name="removal" :checked="removal() === 'confirm'" @change="setRemoval('confirm')">
        <span>Take it out, Messages asks first</span>
      </label>
      <label class="flex items-center gap-2 py-0.5">
        <input type="radio" name="removal" :checked="removal() === 'off'" @change="setRemoval('off')">
        <span>Archive in Attic only</span>
      </label>
      <div class="font-semibold mt-4 mb-1" style="color: var(--label)">Always archive</div>
      <button class="text-left text-[11.5px] border-0 bg-transparent p-0" style="color: var(--accent)" @click="rulesOpen.set(true)">{{ rules().length === 0 ? 'Choose people and groups…' : `${rules().length} ${rules().length === 1 ? 'person or group' : 'people and groups'}…` }}</button>
      <button :if="removal() !== 'off' && !accessible()" class="mt-2 text-left text-[11.5px] border-0 bg-transparent p-0" style="color: var(--accent)" @click="allowAccessibility()">Allow Accessibility so Attic can reach Messages and WhatsApp</button>
      <div :if="fixture() && !presenting" class="mt-3 tag">Sample data</div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Nothing connected yet: the one thing to do first. -->
  <main :if="!anyConnected() && needsAccess()" class="flex-1 grid place-items-center" style="background: var(--pane-bg)">
    <div class="max-w-[460px] text-center px-6">
      <img src="/images/app-icon.png" alt="" class="w-[88px] h-[88px] mx-auto mb-4">
      <h1 class="text-[22px] font-semibold mb-2">Every conversation, one calm place</h1>
      <p class="muted mb-5">Attic reads iMessage on this Mac, and Slack and Discord with your tokens. Start with iMessage: macOS keeps your messages behind a privacy wall, so switch Attic on in Privacy &amp; Security and this window carries on by itself.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-2 justify-center">
        <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--accent); color: #fff; height: 32px; padding: 0 16px" @click="grantAccess()">Open Privacy &amp; Security</button>
        <button class="toolbar-button" style="height: 32px; padding: 0 14px; background: var(--chip)" @click="openConnect('slack')">Connect Slack</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Conversation list. -->
  <section :if="anyConnected() || !needsAccess()" class="w-[340px] shrink-0 flex flex-col border-l border-r" style="background: var(--list-bg); border-color: var(--separator)" aria-label="Conversations">
    <div class="shrink-0 px-3 pb-2" style="padding-top: calc(var(--window-controls-height) + 14px)">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between px-1 mb-2">
        <h2 class="text-[17px] font-bold m-0">{{ listTitle() }}</h2>
        <span class="muted text-[11.5px]">{{ list().length.toLocaleString() }} {{ list().length === 1 ? 'conversation' : 'conversations' }}</span>
      </div>
      <button :if="view() === 'inbox' && !showingResults()" class="toolbar-button w-full justify-center mb-2" style="background: var(--chip)" @click="openBulk()" title="Archive everything that has gone quiet">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-clean text-[15px]"></span>
        <span>{{ bulkJob() && !bulkJob().finished ? `Archiving ${bulkJob().done.toLocaleString()} of ${bulkJob().total.toLocaleString()}…` : 'Clean up…' }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="relative">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-search-01 absolute left-2 top-[7px] text-[14px] muted"></span>
        <input id="search" class="search selectable" type="search" placeholder="Search everything Attic kept" x-model="query" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
      </div>
      <button :if="needsAccess()" class="banner mt-2 w-full text-left border-0" @click="grantAccess()">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-lock-key text-[16px] mt-[1px]" style="color: var(--amber)"></span>
        <span class="text-[11.5px]"><span class="font-semibold">iMessage needs Full Disk Access.</span> <span class="muted">Switch Attic on in Privacy &amp; Security.</span></span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="scroller flex-1 pb-3" tabindex="0" @keydown="onListKey($event)" @scroll="onListScroll($event)">
      <!-- Search results. -->
      <div :if="showingResults()">
        <div :if="!searching() && results().length === 0" class="px-6 py-10 text-center muted">Nothing Attic kept matches.</div>
        <button :for="hit in results()" :key="hit.guid" class="row w-[calc(100%-16px)] text-left border-0 bg-transparent" @click="openResult(hit)">
          <div class="avatar large mt-0.5"><span :class="sourceIcon(hit.provider)"></span></div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="font-semibold truncate">{{ hit.title }}</span>
              <span class="muted text-[11.5px] shrink-0">{{ when(hit.sentAt) }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="muted text-[12px] line-clamp-2"><span class="font-medium mr-1">{{ hit.senderName }}:</span><span :html="snippetHtml(hit.snippet)"></span></div>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- The list itself. -->
      <div :if="!showingResults()">
        <div :if="list().length === 0" class="px-8 py-16 text-center muted">
          <div :if="view() === 'archived'">
            <div class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[34px] mx-auto mb-3"></div>
            <div class="font-semibold mb-1" style="color: var(--label)">Nothing archived yet</div>
            <div class="text-[12px]">Archive a conversation to clear it out of the app without deleting a thing.</div>
          </div>
          <div :if="view() === 'inbox'">All caught up.</div>
        </div>
        <div :for="c in shownList()" :key="c.key" class="row" role="option" :aria-selected="c.key === selectedKey() ? 'true' : 'false'" @click="select(c.key)" @contextmenu="rowMenu($event, c)">
          <span :if="c.unread > 0" class="unread"></span>
          <div class="avatar relative">
            <span :if="c.kind === 'group'" class="i-hugeicons-user-group text-[19px]"></span>
            <span :if="c.kind === 'channel'" class="text-[18px] font-bold">#</span>
            <span :if="c.kind === 'thread'" class="i-hugeicons-message-multiple-02 text-[18px]"></span>
            <span :if="c.kind === 'direct' && c.initials !== '#'">{{ c.initials }}</span>
            <span :if="c.kind === 'direct' && c.initials === '#'" class="i-hugeicons-user text-[19px]"></span>
            <img :if="showAvatar(c.avatar)" class="photo" :src="c.avatar" alt="" loading="lazy" @error="avatarFailed(c.avatar)">
            <span class="source-badge" :style="badgeStyle(c.provider)"><span class="text-[9px] text-white" :class="sourceIcon(c.provider)"></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="font-semibold truncate">{{ c.title }}</span>
              <span class="muted text-[11.5px] shrink-0">{{ when(c.lastMessageAt) }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="muted text-[12px] leading-[1.3] line-clamp-2 min-h-[31px]">{{ preview(c) }}</div>
            <div :if="c.resurfacedAt || !c.inApp || busy() === c.key" class="flex gap-1 mt-1">
              <span :if="busy() === c.key" class="tag">Working…</span>
              <span :if="c.resurfacedAt && c.state === 'inbox'" class="tag"><span class="i-hugeicons-arrow-turn-backward text-[11px]"></span>Wrote again</span>
              <span :if="!c.inApp" class="tag"><span class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[11px]"></span>Out of {{ appName(c.provider) }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Transcript. -->
  <section :if="anyConnected() || !needsAccess()" class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col" style="background: var(--pane-bg)" aria-label="Transcript">
    <div :if="!detail()" class="flex-1 grid place-items-center muted">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="i-hugeicons-message-02 text-[40px] mx-auto mb-3"></div>
        <div>{{ list().length > 0 ? 'Select a conversation' : 'No conversations' }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <header :if="detail()" class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-3 px-4 border-b" style="height: calc(var(--window-controls-height) + 24px); border-color: var(--separator)">
      <div class="avatar large relative shrink-0">
        <span :if="detail()?.kind === 'direct' && detail()?.initials !== '#'">{{ detail()?.initials }}</span>
        <span :if="detail()?.kind !== 'direct' || detail()?.initials === '#'" class="text-[15px]" :class="detail()?.kind === 'direct' ? 'i-hugeicons-user' : detail()?.kind === 'group' ? 'i-hugeicons-user-group' : 'i-hugeicons-message-multiple-02'"></span>
        <img :if="showAvatar(detail()?.avatar)" class="photo" :src="detail()?.avatar" alt="" @error="avatarFailed(detail()?.avatar)">
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <div class="font-semibold text-[14px] truncate">{{ detail()?.title }}</div>
        <div class="muted text-[11.5px] truncate">{{ detail()?.subtitle }}{{ keptSummary(detail()) }}<span :if="detail()?.rule" class="tag ml-1.5" title="New messages reach you, then go into this archive">Always archived</span></div>
      </div>
      <button :if="detail()?.state !== 'archived'" class="toolbar-button" :title="archiveHint(detail())" :disabled="busy() !== ''" @click="archive()">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[16px]"></span>{{ archiveLabel() }}
      </button>
      <button :if="detail()?.state === 'archived'" class="toolbar-button" title="Move to Inbox (⇧⌘U)" @click="unarchive()">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-inbox-upload text-[16px]"></span>Move to Inbox
      </button>
      <button class="toolbar-button" :title="showHint(detail())" :disabled="!detail()?.url" @click="openInMessages()">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-message-02 text-[16px]"></span>
      </button>
    </header>

    <div :if="detail() && !detail()?.inApp" class="shrink-0 px-4 pt-3">
      <div class="banner">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[18px] mt-[1px]" style="color: var(--amber)"></span>
        <div class="text-[12px]">
          <div class="font-semibold">Out of {{ appName(detail()?.provider) }}</div>
          <div class="muted">Attic kept every message and attachment it copied; what the app no longer holds is outlined.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- column-reverse keeps the newest message in view without scripting the scroll. -->
    <div :if="detail()" class="scroller selectable flex-1 flex flex-col-reverse px-5 py-4 gap-[3px]">
      <div :for="row in timeline()" :key="row.id" class="contents">
        <div :if="row.type === 'day'" class="text-center text-[11px] muted font-medium pt-4 pb-1">{{ row.label }}</div>
        <div :if="row.type === 'kept'" class="flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-[11px] muted">
          <span class="flex-1 h-px" style="background: var(--separator)"></span>
          <span>Above: kept by Attic after {{ appName(detail()?.provider) }} removed it</span>
          <span class="flex-1 h-px" style="background: var(--separator)"></span>
        </div>
        <div :if="row.type === 'message' && row.m.kind === 'event'" class="text-center text-[11px] muted py-1">{{ eventText(row.m) }}</div>
        <div :if="row.type === 'message' && row.m.kind === 'message'" class="flex flex-col" :class="row.m.isFromMe ? 'items-end' : 'items-start'" :style="row.m.reactions.length ? 'margin-top: 12px' : ''">
          <div :if="row.showSender" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] muted px-3 pt-1">
            <span :if="showAvatar(row.m.senderAvatar)" class="avatar small relative shrink-0"><img class="photo" :src="row.m.senderAvatar" alt="" loading="lazy" @error="avatarFailed(row.m.senderAvatar)"></span>
            <span>{{ row.m.senderName }}</span>
          </div>
          <div :for="a in row.m.attachments" class="mb-[3px]">
            <img :if="isImage(a)" :src="a.url" :alt="a.name" loading="lazy" class="block max-w-[280px] max-h-[320px] rounded-[16px]" :style="row.m.inApp ? '' : 'outline: 1.5px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 1px'">
            <video :if="isVideo(a)" :src="a.url" controls preload="metadata" class="block max-w-[320px] max-h-[360px] rounded-[16px] bg-black"></video>
            <audio :if="isAudio(a)" :src="a.url" controls preload="metadata" class="block w-[260px]"></audio>
            <div :if="isFile(a)" class="bubble flex items-center gap-2" :class="row.m.isFromMe ? 'out' : 'in'">
              <span class="i-hugeicons-attachment-01 text-[15px]"></span>
              <span>{{ a.name }}</span>
              <span class="opacity-70 text-[11px]">{{ a.available ? bytes(a.bytes) : 'Not downloaded' }}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div :if="quoted(row.m)" class="text-[11.5px] muted px-3 py-1 mb-[2px] max-w-[70%] truncate rounded-[10px]" style="border-left: 2.5px solid var(--separator); background: var(--chip)">{{ quoted(row.m) }}</div>
          <div :if="row.m.text && !row.m.unsent" class="bubble" :class="bubbleClass(row.m)" :style="bubbleStyle(row.m)">
            <div :if="row.m.reactions.length" class="reactions"><span :for="r in row.m.reactions" :title="r.senderName">{{ r.reaction }}</span></div>{{ row.m.text }}</div>
          <div :if="row.m.unsent" class="text-[11px] muted italic px-3">{{ unsentText(row.m) }}</div>
          <div :if="row.m.editedAt" class="text-[10.5px] muted px-3">Edited</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div :if="hasEarlier()" class="text-center py-3">
        <button class="toolbar-button muted" @click="loadEarlier()">Show earlier messages</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Always archive: every rule, each one easy to change or end. -->
  <div :if="rulesOpen()" class="fixed inset-0 grid place-items-center z-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28)" @click="rulesOpen.set(false)">
    <div class="w-[480px] rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-2xl" style="background: var(--pane-bg)" @click="$event.stopPropagation()">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-archive-02 text-[22px]" style="color: var(--accent)"></span>
        <h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold m-0">Always archive</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted text-[12px] leading-relaxed mb-3">New messages from these people and groups still reach you, then go into the archive Attic already keeps for them and leave the app, as any archive does. Moving one back to the Inbox ends its rule. Add one by right-clicking a conversation and choosing Always Archive.</p>
      <div :if="rules().length === 0" class="muted text-[12px] py-6 text-center">No one yet.</div>
      <div :for="r in rules()" :key="r.id" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 border-t" style="border-color: var(--separator)">
        <span class="text-[16px]" :class="sourceIcon(r.provider)" :style="colorStyle(r.provider)"></span>
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <div class="text-[13px] font-medium truncate">{{ r.label || r.value }}</div>
          <div class="muted text-[11px]">{{ r.kind === 'person' ? 'Person' : 'Group' }} on {{ ruleAppName(r.provider) === 'Messages' ? 'iMessage' : ruleAppName(r.provider) }}</div>
        </div>
        <button class="toolbar-button" title="Stop always archiving" @click="deleteRule(r)"><span class="i-hugeicons-cancel-01 text-[14px]"></span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-end mt-4">
        <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--accent); color: #fff" @click="rulesOpen.set(false)">Done</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Clean up: archive everything quiet for longer than a cutoff. -->
  <div :if="bulkOpen()" class="fixed inset-0 grid place-items-center z-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28)" @click="bulkOpen.set(false)">
    <div class="w-[460px] rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-2xl" style="background: var(--pane-bg)" @click="$event.stopPropagation()">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="i-hugeicons-clean text-[24px]" style="color: var(--accent)"></span>
        <h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold m-0">Clean up the Inbox</h2>
      </div>
      <div :if="!bulkJob() || bulkJob().finished">
        <p class="muted text-[12px] leading-relaxed mb-3">Archive every conversation with no messages in the last:</p>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-3">
          <button :for="o in BULK_AGES" class="toolbar-button flex-1 justify-center" :style="bulkDays() === o.days ? 'background: var(--accent); color: #fff' : 'background: var(--chip)'" @click="pickBulkAge(o.days)">{{ o.label }}</button>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[13px] mb-1">
          <span :if="bulkPreview()" class="font-semibold">{{ bulkPreview().total.toLocaleString() }} conversations</span>
          <span :if="!bulkPreview()" class="muted">Counting…</span>
        </div>
        <div :if="bulkPreview()" class="muted text-[11.5px] mb-3">{{ bulkBreakdown() }}</div>
        <p class="muted text-[11.5px] leading-snug mb-1">{{ removal() === 'off' ? 'They are archived in Attic only, as set under When you archive.' : 'Each is copied and checked, then taken out of its app, as any archive is. Messages keeps deleted threads 30 days in Recently Deleted. With thousands this takes a while; it runs in the background.' }}</p>
        <div :if="bulkJob() && bulkJob().finished" class="text-[12px] mt-3 muted">Last run: {{ bulkJob().archived.toLocaleString() }} archived{{ bulkJob().removed ? `, ${bulkJob().removed.toLocaleString()} taken out of the apps` : '' }}{{ bulkJob().failed ? `, ${bulkJob().failed} not copied completely and left in the Inbox` : '' }}{{ bulkJob().cancelled ? ' (stopped)' : '' }}.</div>
        <div class="flex justify-end gap-2 mt-4">
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--chip)" @click="bulkOpen.set(false)">Cancel</button>
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--accent); color: #fff" :disabled="!bulkPreview() || bulkPreview().total === 0" @click="startBulk()">{{ bulkPreview() && bulkPreview().total === 0 ? 'Nothing to archive' : `Archive ${bulkPreview() ? bulkPreview().total.toLocaleString() : ''}` }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div :if="bulkJob() && !bulkJob().finished">
        <p class="text-[13px] mb-2">Archiving {{ bulkJob().done.toLocaleString() }} of {{ bulkJob().total.toLocaleString() }}…</p>
        <div class="h-[6px] rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-2" style="background: var(--chip)"><div class="h-full rounded-full" :style="`width: ${Math.round(100 * bulkJob().done / Math.max(1, bulkJob().total))}%; background: var(--accent); transition: width .3s`"></div></div>
        <p class="muted text-[11.5px] mb-4">Each one is copied and checked before anything leaves an app. You can close this; it keeps going.</p>
        <div class="flex justify-end gap-2">
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--chip)" @click="bulkOpen.set(false)">Hide</button>
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="color: #ff453a" @click="cancelBulk()">Stop</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Connecting a source: a token for Slack or Discord, what is missing for iMessage or WhatsApp. -->
  <div :if="connecting()" class="fixed inset-0 grid place-items-center z-50" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28)" @click="connecting.set('')">
    <div class="w-[440px] rounded-[14px] p-5 shadow-2xl" style="background: var(--pane-bg)" @click="$event.stopPropagation()">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="text-[26px]" :class="sourceIcon(connecting())" :style="colorStyle(connecting())"></span>
        <h2 class="text-[16px] font-semibold m-0">Connect {{ appName(connecting()) }}</h2>
      </div>
      <p :if="connecting() === 'slack'" class="muted text-[12px] leading-relaxed mb-3">Paste a Slack <b>user</b> token (it starts with xoxp-), from a Slack app you create with the read scopes for channels, groups, DMs and users, plus im:write, mpim:write and channels:write so archiving can close and leave conversations. It stays in your keychain.</p>
      <p :if="connecting() === 'discord'" class="muted text-[12px] leading-relaxed mb-3">Paste a Discord <b>bot</b> token and add the bot to your servers with Read Message History (and Manage Threads to archive threads). Discord does not let apps read personal DMs, so those stay in Discord. Your user id marks your own messages.</p>
      <p :if="isLocal(connecting())" class="muted text-[12px] leading-relaxed mb-3">Attic reads {{ appName(connecting()) }} from this Mac, so there is no token. {{ sourceDetail(connecting()) }}</p>
      <input :if="!isLocal(connecting())" class="search selectable mb-2" style="padding-left: 10px" type="password" placeholder="Token" x-model.trim="tokenDraft" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
      <input :if="connecting() === 'discord'" class="search selectable mb-2" style="padding-left: 10px" type="text" placeholder="Your Discord user id (optional)" x-model.trim="userDraft" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-3">
        <button :if="connectedTo(connecting()) && !isLocal(connecting())" class="toolbar-button" style="color: #ff453a" @click="disconnect(connecting())">Disconnect</button>
        <span :if="!connectedTo(connecting()) || isLocal(connecting())"></span>
        <div :if="isLocal(connecting())" class="flex gap-2">
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--accent); color: #fff" @click="connecting.set('')">Done</button>
        </div>
        <div :if="!isLocal(connecting())" class="flex gap-2">
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--chip)" @click="connecting.set('')">Cancel</button>
          <button class="toolbar-button" style="background: var(--accent); color: #fff" :disabled="!tokenDraft()" @click="saveConnect()">Connect</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- A quiet status line for confirmations, bottom centre like a Mail toast. -->
  <div :if="flash()" class="fixed left-1/2 bottom-5 -translate-x-1/2 px-4 py-2 rounded-[10px] text-[12px] text-white shadow-lg max-w-[520px] text-center" style="background: rgba(40, 40, 40, .92)">{{ flash() }}</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
